  "sealed_go_criteria": "20/20 admission conditions 必须按 expected_admission 正确准入或拒绝并通过全部安全、权限、实时性门；20/20 RA-only hold 必须安全且零故障后 coverage；anti-vacuity 必须成立。Immediate comparator 原样报告。",
